# Ignore everything at the repository root by default.
/*

# Keep repository metadata files that define the skill catalog.
!/.gitignore
!/AGENTS.md
!/CLAUDE.md
!/LICENSE
!/README.md
!/README.zh-CN.md
!/test_all_skills.py

# Keep tracked catalog structures and their contents.
!/.agents/
!/.agents/**
!/.claude/
!/.claude/**
!/.cursor/
!/.cursor/**
!/.github/
!/.github/**
!/skills/
!/skills/**
!/tools/
!/tools/**

# Ignore editor, OS, and Python cache files anywhere, including inside allowed paths.
**/.DS_Store
**/.idea/
**/__pycache__/
**/*.pyc
**/.pytest_cache/

# Exclude local development-process documents from all allowed trees.
# Formal product documentation (for example README and references) remains tracked.
**/.memory/
**/memory/
**/memories/
**/plan/
**/plans/
**/scratch/
**/draft/
**/drafts/
**/notes/
**/brainstorm/
**/prompts/
**/transcripts/
**/需求分析/
**/开发文档/
**/开发分析/
**/实现计划/
**/任务拆解/
**/草稿/
**/笔记/
**/requirements-analysis*.md
**/requirements_analysis*.md
**/implementation-plan*.md
**/implementation_plan*.md
**/task-breakdown*.md
**/task_breakdown*.md
**/development-doc*.md
**/development_doc*.md
**/development-analysis*.md
**/development_analysis*.md
**/需求分析*.md
**/开发文档*.md
**/开发分析*.md
**/实现计划*.md
**/任务拆解*.md
**/草稿*.md
**/笔记*.md
